# =======================================================================
# scratch/ — Local Development Scratch Space
# =======================================================================
# PURPOSE:
#   This directory is a safe space for one-off development scripts,
#   temporary utilities, and ad-hoc debugging helpers used during a
#   single development session.
#
# IMPORTANT — DO NOT COMMIT FILES HERE:
#   All files inside scratch/ are intentionally excluded from Git via
#   .gitignore. Only this .gitkeep file is tracked to preserve the
#   directory structure in the repository.
#
# EXAMPLES OF WHAT GOES HERE (locally only, never pushed):
#   - clean_user_data.py  → wipes local DB / Qdrant for a fresh dev run
#   - seed_test_data.py   → inserts test fixtures manually
#   - debug_query.py      → one-off RAG query inspection during dev
#   - check_embeddings.py → spot-check vector output
#
# HOW TO USE:
#   Create any helper script here, run it locally, then delete it.
#   Never import from scratch/ in the main app or tests.
# =======================================================================
